            </style></head><body><div xmlns="" class="page-wrapper"><h2 class="auth__title">Приказ о списании дебиторской задолженности</h2><div class="doc-snippet"></div><div class="page-box" id="doc-box"><div class="doc-page"><div id="documentConftent" class="content content-form"><p align="center"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/dfas1078zl/" data-dfa="dfas1078zl"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/bssPhr1/"></a>Общество с ограниченной ответственностью «Альфа»<span id="sfwc_1" class="sfwc"></span><span class="tooltip__wrapper"><span class="tooltip__point no-print"></span><span class="tooltip_text no-print"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/dfasfrusgt/" data-dfa="dfasfrusgt"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/bssPhr2/"></a>Укажите наименование организации</span></span></p><p align="center"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/dfasqzacuk/" data-dfa="dfasqzacuk"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/bssPhr3/"></a>ПРИКАЗ №&nbsp;12<span id="sfwc_2" class="sfwc"></span><span class="tooltip__wrapper"><span class="tooltip__point no-print"></span><span class="tooltip_text no-print"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/dfastezm5d/" data-dfa="dfastezm5d"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/bssPhr4/"></a>Укажите порядковый номер документа</span></span><br>о списании дебиторской задолженности&nbsp;</p><table width="100%"><tr valign="top"><td><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/dfaspem03m/" data-dfa="dfaspem03m"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/bssPhr5/"></a>г.&nbsp;Ташкент</span></td><td align="right"><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/dfaspu47k0/" data-dfa="dfaspu47k0"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/bssPhr6/"></a>30.01.<year>2026</year></span></td></tr><tr><td width="290pt"></td><td width="318pt"></td></tr></table><p></p><p><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/dfasbpgfe2/" data-dfa="dfasbpgfe2"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/bssPhr7/"></a>На основании <a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/backlinkanchor5/" type="backlink-anchor"></a><a href="#/document/90/21650" class="npd" moduleId="90" documentId="21650">статьи&nbsp;150</a> Гражданского кодекса РУз, акта инвентаризации расчетов с<br>дебиторами и кредиторами от 30.01.2020 №&nbsp;1 <span id="sfwc_3" class="sfwc"></span><span class="tooltip__wrapper"><span class="tooltip__point no-print"></span><span class="tooltip_text no-print"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/dfaske4sid/" data-dfa="dfaske4sid"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/bssPhr8/"></a>Здесь укажите дату и номер составления <a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/backlinkanchor1/" type="backlink-anchor"></a><a href="#/document/118/201596" moduleId="118" documentId="201596">акта инвентаризации</a> к <a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/backlinkanchor2/" type="backlink-anchor"></a><a href="#/document/90/8585" class="npd" data-warm-notices="40373457,40383338,40395241,40405298,40415788,40426327,40436993,40448102,40460822,40471015,40481353,40491571,40501781,40511924,40522423,40532799,40543055,40553259,40563473,40573607,40583827,40594010,40604178,40614386,40624507,40634639,40644765,40654846,40665024,40675234,40685313,40695271,40705371,40715463,40725425,40735434,40745466,40755496,40765691,40775868,40786038,40796144,40806074,40815880" data-warm-notice-type="error" moduleId="90" documentId="8585">НСБУ№19</a></span></span>и бухгалтерской справки от 30.01.2020&nbsp;№&nbsp;4 <span id="sfwc_4" class="sfwc"></span><span class="tooltip__wrapper"><span class="tooltip__point no-print"></span><span class="tooltip_text no-print"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/dfas6hylt1/" data-dfa="dfas6hylt1"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/bssPhr9/"></a>Здесь укажите дату и номер составления <a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/backlinkanchor3/" type="backlink-anchor"></a><a href="#/document/118/201597" moduleId="118" documentId="201597">бухгалтерской справки к акту инвентаризации</a></span></span>с <br>обоснованием причин списания</p><p align="center"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/dfas87k2wn/" data-dfa="dfas87k2wn"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/bssPhr10/"></a>ПРИКАЗЫВАЮ:</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/dfasnnaclr/" data-dfa="dfasnnaclr"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/bssPhr11/"></a>Списать дебиторскую задолженность ООО «Гермес» <span id="sfwc_5" class="sfwc"></span><span class="tooltip__wrapper"><span class="tooltip__point no-print"></span><span class="tooltip_text no-print"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/dfasbob0hq/" data-dfa="dfasbob0hq"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/bssPhr12/"></a>Укажите наименование организации с дебиторской задолженностью</span></span>в размере 300&nbsp;000 (триста тысяч)&nbsp;<span id="sfwc_6" class="sfwc"></span><span class="tooltip__wrapper"><span class="tooltip__point no-print"></span><span class="tooltip_text no-print"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/dfaslk93a8/" data-dfa="dfaslk93a8"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/bssPhr13/"></a>Укажите сумма подтвержденной дебиторской задолженности из <a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/backlinkanchor4/" type="backlink-anchor"></a><a href="#/document/118/201596" moduleId="118" documentId="201596">акта инвентаризации</a></span></span>сумов <br>по причине окончания срока исковой давности. Главному<span id="sfwc_7" class="sfwc"></span><span class="tooltip__wrapper"><span class="tooltip__point no-print"></span><span class="tooltip_text no-print"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/dfashkxg6y/" data-dfa="dfashkxg6y"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/bssPhr14/"></a>Укажите бухгалтеру ,который ведет счет с дебиторской задолженностью и даст проводки к списанию</span></span> бухгалтеру отразить эту операцию в <br>учете.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/dfas2l6tph/" data-dfa="dfas2l6tph"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/bssPhr15/"></a>Контроль за исполнением приказа возлагаю на себя<span id="sfwc_8" class="sfwc"></span><span class="tooltip__wrapper"><span class="tooltip__point no-print"></span><span class="tooltip_text no-print"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/dfasr65qz6/" data-dfa="dfasr65qz6"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/bssPhr16/"></a>Укажите на ком контроль </span></span>.</p><table width="100%"><tr valign="top"><td><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/dfas4lnucp/" data-dfa="dfas4lnucp"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/bssPhr17/"></a>Директор</span></td><td align="center"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/dfasc4e6np/" data-dfa="dfasc4e6np"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/bssPhr18/"></a>&nbsp;</td><td align="center" class="bdBottom"><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/dfas5sczif/" data-dfa="dfas5sczif"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/bssPhr19/"></a>Львов</span></td><td align="center"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/dfas87sg8d/" data-dfa="dfas87sg8d"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/bssPhr20/"></a>&nbsp;</td><td align="center" class="bdBottom"><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/dfas5pc8vg/" data-dfa="dfas5pc8vg"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/bssPhr21/"></a>А.В. Львов</span></td></tr><tr valign="top"><td><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/dfas97bqio/" data-dfa="dfas97bqio"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/bssPhr22/"></a>&nbsp;</td><td align="center"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/dfase156s0/" data-dfa="dfase156s0"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/bssPhr23/"></a>&nbsp;</td><td align="center" class="bdTop"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/dfasowqnr7/" data-dfa="dfasowqnr7"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/bssPhr24/"></a><sup>(подпись)</sup></td><td align="center"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/dfasvkl0z8/" data-dfa="dfasvkl0z8"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/bssPhr25/"></a><sup>&nbsp;</sup></td><td align="center" class="bdTop"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/dfasihy4o3/" data-dfa="dfasihy4o3"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/bssPhr26/"></a><sup>(Ф.И.О.)</sup></td></tr><tr><td width="225pt"></td><td width="46pt"></td><td width="146pt"></td><td width="46pt"></td><td width="153pt"></td></tr></table><p></p><table width="100%"><tr valign="top"><td><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/dfasqrpa9w/" data-dfa="dfasqrpa9w"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/bssPhr27/"></a>С приказом ознакомлен</td><td align="center"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/dfasevpb8t/" data-dfa="dfasevpb8t"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/bssPhr28/"></a>&nbsp;</td><td align="center"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/dfas1ylcg7/" data-dfa="dfas1ylcg7"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/bssPhr29/"></a>&nbsp;</td><td align="center"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/dfast7wg3t/" data-dfa="dfast7wg3t"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/bssPhr30/"></a>&nbsp;</td><td><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/dfasmwh5xx/" data-dfa="dfasmwh5xx"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/bssPhr31/"></a>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr valign="top"><td><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/dfas3905ob/" data-dfa="dfas3905ob"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/bssPhr32/"></a>главный бухгалтер</span></td><td align="center"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/dfaslp0dz4/" data-dfa="dfaslp0dz4"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/bssPhr33/"></a>&nbsp;</td><td align="center" class="bdBottom"><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/dfasvny2ag/" data-dfa="dfasvny2ag"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/bssPhr34/"></a>Иванова</span></td><td align="center"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/dfasd8gvtd/" data-dfa="dfasd8gvtd"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/bssPhr35/"></a>&nbsp;</td><td align="center" class="bdBottom"><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/dfastq1vg6/" data-dfa="dfastq1vg6"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/bssPhr36/"></a>В.Н Зайцева</span></td></tr><tr valign="top"><td><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/dfasi1gy3x/" data-dfa="dfasi1gy3x"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/bssPhr37/"></a>&nbsp;</td><td align="center"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/dfasklmuaf/" data-dfa="dfasklmuaf"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/bssPhr38/"></a>&nbsp;</td><td align="center" class="bdTop"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/dfassppcoy/" data-dfa="dfassppcoy"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/bssPhr39/"></a><sup>(подпись)</sup></td><td align="center"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/dfast76dw7/" data-dfa="dfast76dw7"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/bssPhr40/"></a><sup>&nbsp;</sup></td><td align="center" class="bdTop"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/dfasghaf0v/" data-dfa="dfasghaf0v"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201604/bssPhr41/"></a><sup>(Ф.И.О.)</sup></td></tr><tr><td width="225pt"></td><td width="46pt"></td><td width="146pt"></td><td width="46pt"></td><td width="153pt"></td></tr></table></div><div class="footer">© Материал из ЭС "ACTION: Главбух"<br />https://1gb.uz<br />Дата копирования: 28.09.2026</div></div></div></div></body></html>